<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a third tranche of 2.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a first tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		  Feb 15, 2000   pvs	March 1, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.80 pct    5.33	  5.94 pct     5.58</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.58 pct    6.11	  6.80 pct     6.40</p>
<p> Assigned price 98.70	 99.95	 98.15	  99.75</p>
<p> Bids	     4.74 trln lire	   2.86 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 2.50 trln lire	   2.50 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - The comparisons are with a previous auction on February 14 of a first tranche of the 3-year paper and a final tranche of January 1, 2002 Btps.</p>
</text>
